{"allowed_routes": ["nutrition", "recommendation", "contraindication"], "block_numbers": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], "chunk_id": "A-p04-c01", "contains_table": false, "content": "4.1 减脂人群\n• 热量缺口：每日总热量= 基础代谢× 活动系数- 300~500 千卡\n• 蛋白质优先：每公斤体重1.2-1.6 克蛋白质，保护肌肉\n• 控糖限油：精制糖<25 克/日，烹调油<25 克/日\n• 进食顺序：先吃蔬菜→再吃蛋白质→最后吃碳水，有助于平稳血糖\n• 水分摄入：每日2000-2500 毫升，促进代谢", "forbidden_routes": ["platform"], "page": 4, "page_id": "A-p04", "review_status": "review_required", "schema_version": 1, "section": "4.1 减脂人群", "source_code": "A", "source_role": "core_nutrition", "source_sha256": "44B9A8B1FFDDF08A6F6397563393CF1D786AB210036493DFD0F1DA5788BF4E18", "source_title": "2026秋季健康膳食指南", "source_version": "V2.1", "unknown_glyph_count": 0}
{"allowed_routes": ["nutrition", "recommendation", "contraindication"], "block_numbers": [7, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12], "chunk_id": "A-p04-c02", "contains_table": false, "content": "4.2 增肌人群\n• 热量盈余：每日总热量= 基础代谢× 活动系数+ 300~500 千卡\n• 高蛋白：每公斤体重1.6-2.2 克蛋白质，训练后30 分钟内补充\n• 碳水充足：训练前后补充快碳（香蕉、白米饭）促进恢复\n• 优质脂肪：占总热量20-30%，支持激素合成\n• 餐次分配：每日5-6 餐，避免单次大量进食", "forbidden_routes": ["platform"], "page": 4, "page_id": "A-p04", "review_status": "review_required", "schema_version": 1, "section": "4.2 增肌人群", "source_code": "A", "source_role": "core_nutrition", "source_sha256": "44B9A8B1FFDDF08A6F6397563393CF1D786AB210036493DFD0F1DA5788BF4E18", "source_title": "2026秋季健康膳食指南", "source_version": "V2.1", "unknown_glyph_count": 0}
{"allowed_routes": ["nutrition", "recommendation", "contraindication"], "block_numbers": [13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18], "chunk_id": "A-p04-c03", "contains_table": false, "content": "4.3 控糖人群（糖尿病前期/糖尿病）\n• 低GI 优先：选择GI<55 的食物，避免GI>70 的食物\n• 分餐制：三餐+ 两次加餐，避免单次大量碳水\n• 监测血糖：记录饮食与血糖对应关系，个体化调整\n• 限制水果：选择低糖水果（草莓、蓝莓、柚子），每日￿200 克\n• 避免：果汁、蜂蜜、白糖、精制糕点", "forbidden_routes": ["platform"], "page": 4, "page_id": "A-p04", "review_status": "review_required", "schema_version": 1, "section": "4.3 控糖人群（糖尿病前期/糖尿病）", "source_code": "A", "source_role": "core_nutrition", "source_sha256": "44B9A8B1FFDDF08A6F6397563393CF1D786AB210036493DFD0F1DA5788BF4E18", "source_title": "2026秋季健康膳食指南", "source_version": "V2.1", "unknown_glyph_count": 1}
{"allowed_routes": ["nutrition", "recommendation", "contraindication"], "block_numbers": [19, 20, 21, 22, 23, 24], "chunk_id": "A-p04-c04", "contains_table": false, "content": "4.4 控压人群（高血压）\n• 限盐：每日食盐<5 克，警惕隐形盐（酱油、腌制品、加工食品）\n• DASH 饮食：多蔬果、全谷物、低脂乳制品、少红肉\n• 补钾：香蕉、土豆、菠菜、牛油果有助于排钠\n• 限酒：男性每日酒精<25 克，女性<15 克\n• 避免：腌制食品、加工肉类、浓汤宝、方便面调料包", "forbidden_routes": ["platform"], "page": 4, "page_id": "A-p04", "review_status": "review_required", "schema_version": 1, "section": "4.4 控压人群（高血压）", "source_code": "A", "source_role": "core_nutrition", "source_sha256": "44B9A8B1FFDDF08A6F6397563393CF1D786AB210036493DFD0F1DA5788BF4E18", "source_title": "2026秋季健康膳食指南", "source_version": "V2.1", "unknown_glyph_count": 0}
{"allowed_routes": ["nutrition", "recommendation", "contraindication"], "block_numbers": [26, 27, 28, 29, 30], "chunk_id": "A-p04-c05", "contains_table": false, "content": "5.1 食物相克误区澄清\n健康优选平台基于循证营养学，澄清以下常见误区：\n•\n误区：「豆浆不能与鸡蛋同食」→\n事实：两者可以同食，蛋白质互补\n•\n误区：「菠菜不能与豆腐同食」→\n事实：焯水处理后可同食，草酸影响有限\n•\n误区：「虾不能与维生素C 同食」→\n事实：正常饮食量不会产生砷中毒", "forbidden_routes": ["platform"], "page": 4, "page_id": "A-p04", "review_status": "review_required", "schema_version": 1, "section": "5.1 食物相克误区澄清", "source_code": "A", "source_role": "core_nutrition", "source_sha256": "44B9A8B1FFDDF08A6F6397563393CF1D786AB210036493DFD0F1DA5788BF4E18", "source_title": "2026秋季健康膳食指南", "source_version": "V2.1", "unknown_glyph_count": 0}
{"allowed_routes": ["nutrition", "recommendation", "contraindication"], "block_numbers": [31, 32, 33, 34, 35], "chunk_id": "A-p04-c06", "contains_table": false, "content": "5.2 真正需要注意的饮食禁忌\n• 痛风/高尿酸：严格限制嘌呤（动物内脏、浓肉汤、沙丁鱼、啤酒）\n• 肾病：限制蛋白质总量（0.6-0.8 克/公斤体重），限盐限钾\n• ** Gluten 不耐受（乳糜泻）**：严格避免小麦、大麦、黑麦及其制品\n• 孕期：避免生食（生鱼片、溏心蛋）、限制咖啡因<200 毫克/日、禁酒", "forbidden_routes": ["platform"], "page": 4, "page_id": "A-p04", "review_status": "review_required", "schema_version": 1, "section": "5.2 真正需要注意的饮食禁忌", "source_code": "A", "source_role": "core_nutrition", "source_sha256": "44B9A8B1FFDDF08A6F6397563393CF1D786AB210036493DFD0F1DA5788BF4E18", "source_title": "2026秋季健康膳食指南", "source_version": "V2.1", "unknown_glyph_count": 0}
{"allowed_routes": ["nutrition", "recommendation", "contraindication"], "block_numbers": [0], "chunk_id": "A-p05-c01", "contains_table": false, "content": "• 哺乳期：避免高汞鱼类（鲨鱼、剑鱼、方头鱼），注意过敏原传递", "forbidden_routes": ["platform"], "page": 5, "page_id": "A-p05", "review_status": "review_required", "schema_version": 1, "section": "5.2 真正需要注意的饮食禁忌", "source_code": "A", "source_role": "core_nutrition", "source_sha256": "44B9A8B1FFDDF08A6F6397563393CF1D786AB210036493DFD0F1DA5788BF4E18", "source_title": "2026秋季健康膳食指南", "source_version": "V2.1", "unknown_glyph_count": 0}
{"allowed_routes": ["nutrition", "recommendation", "contraindication"], "block_numbers": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], "chunk_id": "A-p05-c02", "contains_table": false, "content": "5.3 AI 膳食顾问免责声明\n健康优选AI 膳食顾问提供的建议基于《中国居民膳食指南（2026）》及循证营养学研究，仅供参考，不构成医疗诊断或治\n疗建议。患有慢性疾病（糖尿病、肾病、肝病、心血管疾病）或特殊生理状态（孕期、哺乳期、术后恢复期）的用户，应在专\n业医师或注册营养师指导下制定饮食方案。\n文档版本：V2.1 编制：健康优选营养科学部审核：李静注册营养师（RD）| 王磊临床营养科主治医师发布日期：2026\n年8 月15 日", "forbidden_routes": ["platform"], "page": 5, "page_id": "A-p05", "review_status": "review_required", "schema_version": 1, "section": "5.3 AI 膳食顾问免责声明", "source_code": "A", "source_role": "core_nutrition", "source_sha256": "44B9A8B1FFDDF08A6F6397563393CF1D786AB210036493DFD0F1DA5788BF4E18", "source_title": "2026秋季健康膳食指南", "source_version": "V2.1", "unknown_glyph_count": 0}
